          "def-normal-and-conormal-bundles-of-an-embedded-submanifold"
        ],
        "dependency_level": 0,
        "justified_by": [],
        "statement": "For every smooth oriented embedding K:S^1 -> S^3, the rank-two normal bundle nu(K) = TS^3 restricted to K modulo TK, oriented so that a positive tangent to K followed by a positive normal basis gives the orientation of S^3, admits a smooth orientation-preserving trivialization over K.",
        "provenance": {
          "statement": "literature-derived",
          "proof": "ai-generated"
        },
        "sources": {
          "references": [
            {
              "title": "Danny Calegari, Introduction to Knot Theory",
